Dear Busisiwe,

Warm greetings from all of us at Fynbos Ledger, and thank you for being a customer of Garden Route Guesthouse who follows our updates.

Welcome to the November 2026 edition of our monthly newsletter.

Product news this month: We have added a simple invoicing summary view to help you see paid and unpaid invoices at a glance. We have also improved our expense categories so guesthouse costs like linen, cleaning and garden upkeep are easier to track. There is nothing you need to install, the changes are already in your account.

Seasonal tip for the summer months ahead: Many guesthouses see a rise in short stays in December. It can help to review your summer rates early, block off a day for deep cleaning between busy weekends, and keep your breakfast supplies list checking stock weekly.

Thank you for your support. If you have feedback on what you would like us to cover next month, just reply to this mail.

Kind regards,
Riaan Pretorius
Fynbos Ledger

